description.p:
This dev built a messenger from scratch implementing X3DH, Double Ratchet, and Safety Numbers, aiming to architecturally exclude the server from ever reading messages. The breakdown covers the four DH operations and how MITM key substitution gets caught.

{ author: Abhiram }

